stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CheckLibrary
    CheckLibrary --> NoBooks: zero indexed books
    CheckLibrary --> Ready: one or more indexed books
    NoBooks --> Ready: successful import
    Ready --> Retrieving: submit valid question
    Retrieving --> NoEvidence: no supported passages
    Retrieving --> Generating: evidence selected
    Retrieving --> Ready: cancel
    Generating --> Answer: supported response
    Generating --> Fallback: invalid or unsupported output
    Generating --> Timeout: deadline reached
    Generating --> Ready: cancel
    Answer --> EvidenceDetail: open citation
    EvidenceDetail --> Answer: close/back
    Answer --> Retrieving: ask follow-up
    NoEvidence --> Retrieving: edit and retry
    Timeout --> Retrieving: retry
    Timeout --> Ready: dismiss
    Fallback --> EvidenceDetail: open cited excerpt
    Fallback --> Retrieving: ask narrower question

    note right of Retrieving
      Show current stage and elapsed state.
      Cancel remains independently responsive.
    end note

    note right of Fallback
      Deterministic cited excerpts are a valid
      terminal answer, not a hidden error.
    end note
